{"name":"Messemprar","status":"ok","title":"Messemprar","pageId":76430,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\"><nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Messemprar\" title=\"Category:Maps of Messemprar\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Messemprar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TGHoR-p159_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHoR-p159-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires\" title=\"Old Empires\">Old Empires</a><br/><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> <a href=\"/wiki/Unther\" title=\"Unther\">Unther</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p187_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p187-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TGHoR-p159_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHoR-p159-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"end event\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">1385</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Destroyed during the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">98,776 in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a><br/>30,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The <a href=\"/wiki/Northern_Wizards\" title=\"Northern Wizards\">Northern Wizards</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1379_DR\" title=\"1379 DR\">1379 DR</a><br/>Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Annunaki\" title=\"Annunaki\">Annunaki</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Messemprar\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Messemprar\">Inhabitants of  Messemprar</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Messemprar\" title=\"Category:Locations in Messemprar\">Locations in  Messemprar</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9NZXNzZW1wcmFyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Messemprar (page does not exist)\">Organizations in  Messemprar</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Messemprar</b> was a city in <a href=\"/wiki/Unther\" title=\"Unther\">Unther</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> At some point during the country's history, Messemprar was its largest city, but by the 14<sup>th</sup> century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a> had shrank both in importance and in size.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Population\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Population</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Messemprar?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>Circa</i> <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a>, the city was governed by Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Annunaki\" title=\"Annunaki\">Annunaki</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Around <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>, and until the subjugation of the city by <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1379_DR\" title=\"1379 DR\">1379 DR</a>,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TGHoR-p159_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHoR-p159-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Messemprar was ruled by the <a href=\"/wiki/Northern_Wizards\" title=\"Northern Wizards\">Northern Wizards</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>After that year, and until the destruction of Messemprar, in <a href=\"/wiki/1385_DR\" title=\"1385 DR\">1385 DR</a>,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p187_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p187-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> the city was ruled by the Mulhorandi occupation forces.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TGHoR-p159_2-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHoR-p159-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Population\">Population</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Population\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Messemprar?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Population\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It had a population of 30,000 <i>circa</i> 1357, before the riots.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> By 1372 DR, the population had increased to 98,776 citizens, approximately.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Messemprar?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Messemprar was at one time the biggest city in the Untheric empire. It was a key stop on a trade route linking <a href=\"/wiki/Sultim\" title=\"Sultim\">Sultim</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bezantur\" title=\"Bezantur\">Bezantur</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Mourktar\" title=\"Mourktar\">Mourktar</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> When merchants began to avoid Unther's ports because of the high taxes <a href=\"/wiki/Gilgeam\" title=\"Gilgeam\">Gilgeam</a> imposed on them, this affected the economy of the city,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and by 1357 DR had shrunken considerably in both size and importance.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_1-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>However, in 1357 DR, a protest against taxes sparked riots over food, then escalated into open revolt. A large number of the city guards were slain in the fighting, and an angry mob laid siege to the royal palace for several weeks. The city fell into chaos and was divided between several factions. Lord Annunaki and his remaining guard held the palace district, while the Northern Wizards dominated the southern parts and the city gates, thus controlling the main entrance and exit. Finally, \"non-slaves\" (former slaves who'd renounced their freedom) controlled the docks district. Trade ships completely avoided Messemprar, and the west coast of the <a href=\"/wiki/Alamber\" title=\"Alamber\">Alamber</a>, during the turmoil.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_1-7\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The Northern Wizards came to completely rule Messemprar in <a href=\"/wiki/1358_DR\" title=\"1358 DR\">1358 DR</a>,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> after the death of Gilgeam.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TGHoR-p142_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHoR-p142-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The peace of free Unther was brief, however, as in <a href=\"/wiki/1371_DR\" title=\"1371 DR\">1371 DR</a> Mulhorand invaded Unther and conquered most of the country in less than a year, with Messemprar remaining as the last free city of a diminished Unther.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TGHoR-p151_6-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHoR-p151-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Messemprar became a haven for refugees and adventuring groups trying to profit from the situation, either by helping the Northern Wizards to protect their city, or selling necessary goods, such as food.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-7\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Despite all the efforts from the defenders, Messemprar was finally conquered by Mulhorand in 1379 DR.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TGHoR-p159_2-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TGHoR-p159-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The Mulhorandi rule over the city was also brief as, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a> of 1385 DR, Messemprar was destroyed during the catastrophe, when the landing of <a href=\"/wiki/Djerad_Thymar\" title=\"Djerad Thymar\">Djerad Thymar</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Toril\" title=\"Toril\">Toril</a> caused the waters of the Alamber to completely drown Messemprar.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p187_4-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p187-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>By <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a>, Messemprar's ruins were inhabited by <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin\" title=\"Sahuagin\">sahuagin</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p187_4-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p187-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Messemprar?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Messemprar?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-OE-p43-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_1-6\">1.6</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_1-7\">1.7</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scott_Bennie\" title=\"Scott Bennie\">Scott Bennie